## card
cards are meant to be loaded from serialized so game designers can tweak them easily
### fields
- id: int
- cost: int
- displayName : String
- description : String
- effect: Array[iEffect]
	- effect is hard. there are cards like "reposition anywhere, gain 1 block
	if you swapped with another player"
	- sometimes cards interact with a classes ability
	- example for assassain:
	Passive: Slip Stream, Every time you are swapped with an ally, you gain 1 momentum (3 max).
	- If you deal M, you add 2M for each momentum you have
	- If you take damage, you gain 1 block for each momentum you have
	- You lose all momentum after you deal M damage or take damage

	and how a card may interact
	- Quick Attack (1 cost) x2
	2M, you may choose to not spend your momentum
	- Acrobatics (1 cost) x2
	Reposition, then gain 2 momentum

